### 国内用户邮箱认证 API 测试文件
### 使用 VS Code REST Client 插件运行

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. 测试注册接口
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth-cn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test123456",
  "action": "signup"
}

### 2. 测试重复注册（应该失败）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth-cn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test123456",
  "action": "signup"
}

### 3. 测试登录接口
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth-cn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test123456",
  "action": "login"
}

### 4. 测试错误密码
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth-cn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword",
  "action": "login"
}

### 5. 测试密码长度验证
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth-cn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test2@example.com",
  "password": "12345",
  "action": "signup"
}

### 6. 测试必填字段验证
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth-cn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test3@example.com"
}


